**Last commit:** (about to be committed below)

## Summary

AUR dependency tree visualization (Task 3 of the AUR security heuristics plan).
Added `_build_dep_tree()` to the API — batch-resolves AUR info for all
direct dependencies, colors by source (repo/AUR) and warnings (orphaned, out of date),
recurses one level for AUR deps' own deps. Injected as `dep_tree` into the install
preview payload alongside existing flat dep lists.

Frontend: `renderDepTree()` replaces the flat chip accordion for AUR installs with
a collapsible color-coded tree. Green = repo, amber = AUR clean, red = AUR with
warnings. Inline source badges and warning labels. JS contract test added.

**Verification:** 737 tests passed, JS contracts green.
